                                                                                                     "heading":  "Product Specifications",
                                                                                                     "content":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHigh-Resilience Mattress:\u003c/strong\u003e Full-length mattress is generously filled with premium cotton or foam, supporting the body with a soft yet sturdy surface that fits the spine and relieves pressure points throughout the day.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBreathable Fabric Upholstery:\u003c/strong\u003e Mattress is wrapped in high-quality plaid or woven fabric, which is comfortable, sweat-absorbent, and highly breathable, keeping users cool in summer and warm in winter.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStable 8-Leg Support Structure:\u003c/strong\u003e Upgraded foldable bed stands on eight strong legs, providing increased load-bearing and enhancing safety during use. The frame sits flat and stable on any surface for secure rest\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMulti-Level Adjustable Backrest:\u003c/strong\u003e Enjoy personalized comfort with up to 6 gear positions for sitting, reclining, or sleeping. The bed transforms easily to suit reading, napping, or overnight rest needs\u003c/p\u003e"
                                                                                                 }
                                                                                },
