                                                                                                "heading":  "Product features",
                                                                                                "content":  "\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIntegrated Folding Design:\u003c/strong\u003e No installation required—simply unfold and use. The lightweight frame folds compactly for effortless storage and portability.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSoundproof Cloth Stitching:\u003c/strong\u003e The frame and mattress are joined with sound-absorbing fabric, minimizing movement noise and ensuring restful, undisturbed sleep.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePremium Build Quality:\u003c/strong\u003e Features thickened metal accessories, oxford cloth supports, and non-slip foot pads for extra durability and user safety.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e",
