                                                                                                      "heading":  "Materials and care",
                                                                                                      "content":  "\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFrame:\u003c/strong\u003e High-grade steel pipe with flush connection technology for precise support, strong load-bearing, and long-lasting durability.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMattress:\u003c/strong\u003e High-resilience cotton/foam filling encased in breathable plaid fabric or durable oxford cloth for comfort and health.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUpholstery:\u003c/strong\u003e Cover is soft, sweat-absorbent, and non-irritating to skin. It is designed for all-season use, resisting pilling and maintaining shape.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNon-Slip Foot Pads:\u003c/strong\u003e Provide additional safety on a variety of surfaces and protect flooring from scratches.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCare Instructions:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eClean with a soft brush or vacuum regularly to remove dust from the \u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e{{ block.settings.page.content }}\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003esurface.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eSpot-clean spills with a damp cloth, using mild detergent if necessary.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eAllow fabric to air dry naturally; avoid exposure to excessive moisture or direct sunlight for long periods.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eDo not use bleach or abrasive cleaners.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eStore folded bed in a dry, ventilated area when not in use.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e",
